From: Lee_Alderman <tinytim3271@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 05:20:07 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Refuse-services archive, search focus fix, review fixes

- Job card approval type now has "Customer refused services": it asks for
  confirmation, then archives the job card (POST /entities/orders/<id>/refuse,
  owner/admin/service writer); the refusal is kept and an admin can restore it.
- Search boxes keep focus and the caret while the page re-renders, so typing
  no longer drops out of the box after each letter; the search value is escaped.
- Review fixes: saves can no longer set or change archive fields; deposits
  taken on the work order count as invoice payments; archive and restore update
  only the archive fields (concurrent edits kept, updatedAt synced); archived
  invoices and payments stay loaded for accounting but are hidden from lists;
  archived vehicles left out of customer search; light-only contrast colors
  scoped to light mode; restore refreshes customers; portable test path;
  single apksigner.
- Smoke: unambiguous restore button, HTTPS Twilio callback origin, no stray
  unhandled waits.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GGEY5cQcwh34RQLfpVUQwK
